  "result": "Lean module CampaignPgwKItemDeltaGrammar compiles under Lean 4.35.0 with pinned Mathlib v4.35.0, built through lake from the non-default CampaignPgwKItemDeltaGrammar library. Printed axioms are among propext, Classical.choice and Quot.sound. The outcome is Narrowed: one empty base, two data, arity one, and a 10-atom census of length at most 2, not a k-item grammar.",
